# Baseline hardening headers, every response. The site is already HTTPS-only (Cloudflare redirects
# both the apex and plain http:// -- see 40ktracker.com's DNS/proxy config, not this repo), so HSTS
# just makes that explicit to returning browsers instead of relying on the redirect every time; it
# doesn't change any request this app itself makes (Supabase, Google OAuth) since those are a
# separate origin's own headers, not ours. X-Frame-Options: DENY blocks embedding this app in
# someone else's iframe -- nothing here is meant to be framed. Deliberately no Content-Security-
# Policy yet: getting one right without breaking the Google OAuth redirect, Supabase API/Storage
# calls, and avatar/layout images needs its own careful pass, not a drive-by addition alongside
# these two.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY

# The generated service worker (vite-plugin-pwa, see vite.config.ts) isn't content-hashed, so a
# CDN- or browser-cached copy of it would delay how quickly a new deploy's precache manifest is
# picked up -- registerType: 'prompt' already avoids a surprise mid-game reload (see
# UpdatePrompt.tsx), but that only works if the browser actually notices there's a new sw.js to
# compare against.
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
